WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.340
In this lesson we build the data model.

2
00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:09.219
Here in Model view, each box is a table, such as Customers, Orders, Products, and Categories.

3
00:00:09.219 --> 00:00:14.363
Right now the tables are not connected, so Power BI does not know how

4
00:00:14.363 --> 00:00:16.200
they relate to each other.

5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.871
On the Home tab, I open Manage relationships and click Autodetect.

6
00:00:31.871 --> 00:00:38.071
Power BI compares the column names and data in each table, and finds thirteen

7
00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:39.400
relationships for us.

8
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.450
Autodetect is a good start, but it only guesses.

9
00:00:55.450 --> 00:01:01.583
It matches columns that look alike, such as Customer ID in the Customers and Orders tables.

10
00:01:01.583 --> 00:01:05.800
It can miss a relationship, or create one that is wrong.

11
00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:08.100
So we always check the result.

12
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.471
Here is the list of relationships.

13
00:01:38.471 --> 00:01:44.235
For each one we see the two tables, the columns that connect them, and

14
00:01:44.235 --> 00:01:47.118
whether the relationship is active or inactive.

15
00:01:47.118 --> 00:01:50.000
Running Autodetect again finds no new relationships.

16
00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:53.797
Back in Model view, lines now connect the tables.

17
00:01:53.797 --> 00:01:59.081
The numbers and arrows on each line show the cardinality, for example one to

18
00:01:59.081 --> 00:02:02.100
many, and the direction in which filters flow.

19
00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:24.697
To start again, or to remove relationships that are wrong, select them in Manage

20
00:02:24.697 --> 00:02:26.324
relationships and click Delete.

21
00:02:26.324 --> 00:02:30.800
Then you can create the correct ones yourself with New relationship.

22
00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:45.722
A clean model, with clear relationships between your fact tables and your lookup tables,

23
00:02:45.722 --> 00:02:49.400
makes every report faster and every number more reliable.

